   222	  - for A, any item type other than `agent_message` or `reasoning` (so any `command_execution`, `file_change`, `mcp_tool_call` or `web_search`),
   223	    or any event type outside thread.started, turn.started, item.started, item.updated, item.completed and turn.completed;
