**Version 8 still has one retry that reveals the earlier conclusion.** The third-reader retry reason “your own answer does not fit the shape” tells the fresh reader that the earlier ruling was **“neither”**, because only that ruling carries an answer. Make this reason a general shape rule that does not disclose which ruling was made. [Retry reasons](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/stage-b-controls/review-v8/templates/third-reader-ask-again-reasons.json:6), [third-reader output](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/stage-b-controls/review-v8/templates/third-reader.md:9).

Two other points affect what Alex sees or how the result is understood:

- **D263 disclosure:** The design says the signing page will explain that the judge was tuned to the earlier reader B’s reasoning, but the page’s enumerated contents omit that disclosure. Add it to the generated page before Alex signs. [Disclosure](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/stage-b-controls/review-v8/NEW-REFERENCE-DESIGN-v8.md:275), [signing page](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/stage-b-controls/review-v8/NEW-REFERENCE-DESIGN-v8.md:295).
- **Knowledge probe:** Three unknown answers do not show that neither model knows *any* post-window facts. The change list makes that broader claim. Report the actual three-question result and the stated cutoff, with the remaining uncertainty, on the signing page. [Probe](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/stage-b-controls/review-v8/NEW-REFERENCE-DESIGN-v8.md:200), [change list](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/stage-b-controls/review-v8/NEW-REFERENCE-DESIGN-v8.md:470).

The direct comparison with the stripped question file, one-control or one-point shown-check sessions, and stopping a live interrupted process address the other round-7 findings. [Question check](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/stage-b-controls/review-v8/NEW-REFERENCE-DESIGN-v8.md:152), [shown check](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/stage-b-controls/review-v8/NEW-REFERENCE-DESIGN-v8.md:341), [interruption](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/stage-b-controls/review-v8/NEW-REFERENCE-DESIGN-v8.md:231).

NOT READY: Make the third-reader retry blind and include the accurately bounded D263 and knowledge-probe disclosures on the signing page.
